{"id":72141,"date":"2026-10-31T22:11:55","date_gmt":"2026-10-31T22:11:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72141"},"modified":"2026-11-02T14:07:25","modified_gmt":"2026-11-02T13:07:25","slug":"trail-de-conimbriga-terras-de-sico","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-de-conimbriga-terras-de-sico\/","title":{"rendered":"XVIII Trail de Conimbriga Terras de Sic\u00f3 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">XVIII Trail de Conimbriga Terras de Sic\u00f3 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>XVIII Trail de Conimbriga Terras de Sic\u00f3 2027<\/strong> (18\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do hist\u00f3rico <strong>Trail de Con\u00edmbriga Terras de Sic\u00f3<\/strong>) realiza-se nos dias <strong>26, 27 e 28 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, com centro nevr\u00e1lgico na <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio<\/strong>, em <strong>Condeixa-a-Nova<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. Um dos mais antigos e emblem\u00e1ticos eventos de trail e ultra-endurance de Portugal atravessa seis concelhos do maci\u00e7o calc\u00e1rio das Terras de Sic\u00f3 \u2014 <strong>Condeixa-a-Nova, Penela, Soure, Ansi\u00e3o, Alvai\u00e1zere e Pombal<\/strong> \u2014, sendo pontu\u00e1vel para a <strong>ITRA<\/strong> e prova qualificativa para a <strong>Western States 2028<\/strong> (para todos os atletas que concluam os 111 km em menos de 24 horas).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo desdobra-se por tr\u00eas dias e sete dist\u00e2ncias homologadas pelos escal\u00f5es de esfor\u00e7o da FPA: na sexta-feira (26 de fevereiro) partem as \u00e9picas <strong>111 Milhas Terras de Sic\u00f3 \/ 178 km<\/strong> (<strong>6208 m D+<\/strong>, grau XXL, limite de 40h, com bases de vida em Ansi\u00e3o e Pousadas Vedras) \u00e0s 09:00 e o <strong>Trail Ultra Endurance 111 km<\/strong> (<strong>4200 m D+<\/strong>, grau L, limite de 26h, com base de vida em Santiago da Guarda) \u00e0s 22:00; no s\u00e1bado (27 de fevereiro) disputam-se o <strong>Trail Ultra 60 km<\/strong> (<strong>2443 m D+<\/strong>, partida em Santiago da Guarda \u00e0s 08:30, limite de 13h) e a <strong>Maratona Trail 42 km<\/strong> (<strong>1843 m D+<\/strong>, partida em Condeixa \u00e0s 09:00, limite de 8h30); e no domingo (28 de fevereiro) encerram a festa o <strong>Trail Longo 25 km<\/strong> (<strong>1131 m D+<\/strong>, \u00e0s 08:30), o <strong>Trail Mini 13 km<\/strong> (<strong>423 m D+<\/strong>, \u00e0s 09:00) e a prova de <strong>13 km a correr ou caminhar<\/strong> (<strong>365 m D+<\/strong>, \u00e0s 09:15).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva O Mundo da Corrida<\/strong> com dire\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica certificada pela FPA e cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica <strong>MyLaps<\/strong>, a prova disponibiliza geolocalizador nos 178 km e 111 km, massagem nas bases de vida e na meta, piso duro no Pavilh\u00e3o de Condeixa e banhos quentes. Atletas federados de clubes do concelho de Condeixa-a-Nova usufruem de 50% de desconto at\u00e9 31 de janeiro de 2027 (exceto nas provas de 111 Milhas e 111 km) e federados na ADAC beneficiam de 1,50 \u20ac de desconto na prova do Circuito Mini. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 a 28 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><s