ng: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 14,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01 a 15\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 16,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/08 a 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 18,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 21\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Mini 13 Km (Correr ou Caminhar \u2014 N\u00e3o Competitivo)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 28 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15 \u2022 \u26f0\ufe0f 365m D+ \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: 4 horas<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83c\udf92 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Material Obrigat\u00f3rio:<\/strong> Copo ou reservat\u00f3rio pr\u00f3prio<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa e 2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/08 a 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 21\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o XVIII Trail de Con\u00edmbriga Terras de Sic\u00f3 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O XVIII Trail de Con\u00edmbriga Terras de Sic\u00f3 realiza-se nos dias 26, 27 e 28 de fevereiro de 2027, com centro de evento e secretariado na Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio (junto ao Cacifo Locky), em Condeixa-a-Nova, distrito de Coimbra. Os percursos atravessam seis concelhos: Condeixa-a-Nova, Penela, Soure, Ansi\u00e3o, Alvai\u00e1zere e Pombal.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida, dist\u00e2ncias e tempos limite das 7 provas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na sexta-feira (26 de fevereiro) partem as 111 Milhas \/ 178 km (6208 m D+, limite de 40h) \u00e0s 09:00 e os 111 km (4200 m D+, limite de 26h) \u00e0s 22:00. No s\u00e1bado (27 de fevereiro) partem o Trail Ultra 60 km (2443 m D+, limite de 13h, com partida em Santiago da Guarda e autocarros \u00e0s 07:30) \u00e0s 08:30 e a Maratona Trail 42 km (1843 m D+, limite de 8h30) \u00e0s 09:00. No domingo (28 de fevereiro) partem o Trail Longo 25 km (1131 m D+, limite de 5h) \u00e0s 08:30, o Trail Mini 13 km (423 m D+, limite de 3h) \u00e0s 09:00 e a Caminhada\/Corrida 13 km n\u00e3o competitiva (365 m D+, limite de 4h) \u00e0s 09:15.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 1 de agosto de 2026 a 21 de fevereiro de 2027 em 4 fases: nas 111 Milhas variam entre 95,00 \u20ac e 120,00 \u20ac; nos 111 km entre 70,00 \u20ac e 85,00 \u20ac; nos 60 km entre 50,00 \u20ac e 65,00 \u20ac; nos 42 km entre 38,00 \u20ac e 50,00 \u20ac; nos 25 km entre 24,00 \u20ac e 35,00 \u20ac; no Trail Mini 13 km entre 14,00 \u20ac e 20,00 \u20ac; e na Caminhada 13 km entre 12,00 \u20ac e 15,00 \u20ac. A t-shirt t\u00e9cnica \u00e9 opcional por 3,00 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio e onde funcionam as bases de vida?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Em todas as provas competitivas \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel carregado, apito e copo pr\u00f3prio (a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece copos). Nas provas de 111 Milhas e 111 km \u00e9 tamb\u00e9m obrigat\u00f3rio usar rel\u00f3gio GPS ou telem\u00f3vel com o track ativo e geolocalizador entregue pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o. As bases de vida funcionam em Ansi\u00e3o e Pousadas Vedras (111 Milhas) e em Santiago da Guarda (111 km).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova atribui pontua\u00e7\u00e3o ITRA e qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o para a Western States?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o evento atribui pontua\u00e7\u00e3o ITRA e os atletas que conclu\u00edrem a prova de 111 km dentro de 24 horas garantem qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o para o sorteio da Western States 2028. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip MyLaps, massagem nas bases de vida e na meta, piso duro no Pavilh\u00e3o de Condeixa e banhos \u00e0 chegada.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"XVIII Trail de Conimbriga Terras de Sic\u00f3 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-26\", \"endDate\": \"2027-02-26\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Condeixa-a-Nova, Coimbra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Condeixa-a-Nova\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O XVIII Trail de Con\u00edmbriga Terras de Sic\u00f3 2027 realiza-se de 26 a 28 de fevereiro em Condeixa-a-Nova. Provas de 111 milhas a 13 km. Garante o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-de-conimbriga-terras-de-sico.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"111 Milhas Terras de Sic\u00f3 \u2014 Ultra Endurance XXL (178 Km)\", \"price\": \"120.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.omdceventos.com\/evento\/xviii-trail-de-conimbriga-terras-de-sico\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Ultra Endurance 111 Km\", \"price\": \"85.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.omdceventos.com\/evento\/xviii-trail-de-conimbriga-terras-de-sico\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Ultra 60 Km\", \"price\": \"65.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.omdceventos.com\/evento\/xviii-trail-de-conimbriga-terras-de-sico\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Maratona Trail 42 Km\", \"price\": \"50.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.omdceventos.com\/evento\/xviii-trail-de-conimbriga-terras-de-sico\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo 25 Km\", \"price\": \"35.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.omdceventos.com\/evento\/xviii-trail-de-conimbriga-terras-de-sico\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Mini 13 Km\", \"price\": \"20.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.omdceventos.com\/evento\/xviii-trail-de-conimbriga-terras-de-sico\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Mini 13 Km (Correr ou Caminhar \u2014 N\u00e3o Competitivo)\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.omdceventos.com\/evento\/xviii-trail-de-conimbriga-terras-de-sico\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva O Mundo da Corrida\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o XVIII Trail de Con\u00edmbriga Terras de Sic\u00f3 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O XVIII Trail de Con\u00edmbriga Terras de Sic\u00f3 realiza-se nos dias 26, 27 e 28 de fevereiro de 2027, com centro de evento e secretariado na Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio (junto ao Cacifo Locky), em Condeixa-a-Nova, distrito de Coimbra. Os percursos atravessam seis concelhos: Condeixa-a-Nova, Penela, Soure, Ansi\u00e3o, Alvai\u00e1zere e Pombal.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida, dist\u00e2ncias e tempos limite das 7 provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na sexta-feira (26 de fevereiro) partem as 111 Milhas \/ 178 km (6208 m D+, limite de 40h) \u00e0s 09:00 e os 111 km (4200 m D+, limite de 26h) \u00e0s 22:00. No s\u00e1bado (27 de fevereiro) partem o Trail Ultra 60 km (2443 m D+, limite de 13h, com partida em Santiago da Guarda e autocarros \u00e0s 07:30) \u00e0s 08:30 e a Maratona Trail 42 km (1843 m D+, limite de 8h30) \u00e0s 09:00. No domingo (28 de fevereiro) partem o Trail Longo 25 km (1131 m D+, limite de 5h) \u00e0s 08:30, o Trail Mini 13 km (423 m D+, limite de 3h) \u00e0s 09:00 e a Caminhada\/Corrida 13 km n\u00e3o competitiva (365 m D+, limite de 4h) \u00e0s 09:15.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 1 de agosto de 2026 a 21 de fevereiro de 2027 em 4 fases: nas 111 Milhas variam entre 95,00 \u20ac e 120,00 \u20ac; nos 111 km entre 70,00 \u20ac e 85,00 \u20ac; nos 60 km entre 50,00 \u20ac e 65,00 \u20ac; nos 42 km entre 38,00 \u20ac e 50,00 \u20ac; nos 25 km entre 24,00 \u20ac e 35,00 \u20ac; no Trail Mini 13 km entre 14,00 \u20ac e 20,00 \u20ac; e na Caminhada 13 km entre 12,00 \u20ac e 15,00 \u20ac. A t-shirt t\u00e9cnica \u00e9 opcional por 3,00 \u20ac.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio e onde funcionam as bases de vida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Em todas as provas competitivas \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel carregado, apito e copo pr\u00f3prio (a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece copos). Nas provas de 111 Milhas e 111 km \u00e9 tamb\u00e9m obrigat\u00f3rio usar rel\u00f3gio GPS ou telem\u00f3vel com o track ativo e geolocalizador entregue pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o. As bases de vida funcionam em Ansi\u00e3o e Pousadas Vedras (111 Milhas) e em Santiago da Guarda (111 km).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova atribui pontua\u00e7\u00e3o ITRA e qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o para a Western States?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, o evento atribui pontua\u00e7\u00e3o ITRA e os atletas que conclu\u00edrem a prova de 111 km dentro de 24 horas garantem qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o para o sorteio da Western States 2028. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip MyLaps, massagem nas bases de vida e na meta, piso duro no Pavilh\u00e3o de Condeixa e banhos \u00e0 chegada.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":72142,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,672,497,622,498,499],"event_type_2":[37,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-72141","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-condeixa-a-nova-coimbra","event_type-trail","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-endurance","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-coimbra","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-de-conimbriga-terras-de-sico.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/72141","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=72141"}],"version-hi